    "A host and port, or a full ws:// URL. A pasted pairing link works too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ホストとポート、または ws:// で始まる URL。ペアリングリンクを貼り付けても構いません。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host at port, o buong ws:// URL. Puwede rin ang na-paste na pairing link."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机和端口，或完整的 ws:// 地址。粘贴配对链接也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A public server running a scripted session. Nothing in it runs on your computer, and nothing you send it is executed.": {
      "comment": "Footer under the demo daemon's details in Settings.",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スクリプト化されたセッションを配信する公開サーバーです。あなたのコンピューターでは何も実行されず、送信した内容も実行されません。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pampublikong server na may nakascript na session. Walang tumatakbo sa computer mo, at walang ini-execute sa ipinapadala mo."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行脚本会话的公共服务器。它不会在你的电脑上运行任何东西，你发送的内容也不会被执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A scratch workspace has no repository to branch from": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スクラッチワークスペースには分岐元のリポジトリがありません"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walang repository ang scratch workspace na puwedeng pag-branch-an"
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "临时工作区没有可供创建分支的仓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
