    "Shidou connects only to a daemon you run. It has no server of its own and collects nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shidou は、あなたが動かしているデーモンにのみ接続します。独自のサーバーは持たず、何も収集しません。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa daemon mo lang kumokonekta ang Shidou. Wala itong sariling server at walang kinokolektang anuman."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shidou 只连接你自己运行的守护进程。它没有自己的服务器，也不收集任何数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shidou for iOS collects nothing and talks to no server of its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shidou for iOS は何も収集せず、独自のサーバーとも通信しません。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walang kinokolekta ang Shidou for iOS at hindi ito nakikipag-usap sa sarili nitong server."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shidou for iOS 不收集任何数据，也不与自己的服务器通信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shidou is translated into English, Japanese, Filipino and Simplified Chinese. iOS keeps the choice, in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shidou は英語・日本語・フィリピン語・簡体字中国語に翻訳されています。言語の選択は iOS の設定にあります。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isinalin ang Shidou sa English, Japanese, Filipino at Simplified Chinese. Sa Settings ng iOS nakalagay ang pagpili."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shidou 已翻译为英语、日语、菲律宾语和简体中文。语言选择由 iOS 在“设置”中保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shidou needs it to reach a Mac on the same Wi-Fi. Check Settings → Privacy & Security → Local Network, or connect over Tailscale instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ Wi-Fi 上の Mac に接続するために必要です。設定 → プライバシーとセキュリティ → ローカルネットワーク を確認するか、Tailscale 経由で接続してください。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kailangan ito ng Shidou para maabot ang Mac sa parehong Wi-Fi. Tingnan ang Settings → Privacy & Security → Local Network, o kumonekta sa Tailscale."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shidou 需要它才能访问同一 Wi-Fi 下的 Mac。请检查 设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 本地网络，或改用 Tailscale 连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shidou runs on your own computer. Pair this phone with its daemon to see your sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shidou はあなた自身のコンピューターで動きます。この iPhone をデーモンとペアリングするとセッションが見られます。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sa sarili mong computer tumatakbo ang Shidou. I-pair ang telepono sa daemon nito para makita ang mga session mo."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shidou 运行在你自己的电脑上。将这部手机与它的守护进程配对即可查看你的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows or hides your Archived Tasks": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アーカイブ済みタスクの表示を切り替えます"
