        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务历史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tasks, projects and transcripts live on the Mac you paired with. This phone keeps only that Mac's address and its token.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タスク・プロジェクト・会話はペアリングした Mac にあります。この iPhone が保持するのは、その Mac のアドレスとトークンだけです。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nasa Mac na pinares mo ang mga task, proyekto at transcript. Ang address at token lang ng Mac na iyon ang itinatago ng teleponong ito."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务、项目和对话记录都保存在你配对的 Mac 上。这部手机只保存那台 Mac 的地址和令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent reads the diff on your Mac and writes the message there. Nothing is sent anywhere else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントは Mac 上で差分を読み、そこでメッセージを書きます。他のどこにも送信されません。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Binabasa ng agent ang diff sa Mac mo at doon isinusulat ang mensahe. Walang ipinapadala sa ibang lugar."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体在你的 Mac 上读取差异并在那里写出信息。不会发送到其他任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The daemon could not include full context for this change. Some lines are missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "デーモンはこの変更の完全なコンテキストを含められませんでした。一部の行が欠けています。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hindi maisama ng daemon ang buong konteksto ng pagbabagong ito. May kulang na mga linya."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守护进程无法包含此更改的完整上下文，部分行缺失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The daemon token travels in the clear on your local network. On an untrusted network, connect over Tailscale instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "デーモントークンはローカルネットワーク上を平文で流れます。信頼できないネットワークでは Tailscale 経由で接続してください。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plain text ang pagdaan ng daemon token sa local network mo. Sa hindi pinagkakatiwalaang network, kumonekta sa Tailscale."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守护进程令牌会以明文形式在本地网络上传输。在不可信的网络上，请改用 Tailscale 连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The skill's folder moves to the Trash on your Mac. Nothing is deleted outright.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スキルのフォルダは Mac のゴミ箱に移動します。完全には削除されません。"
          }
        },
        "tl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ililipat sa Trash ng Mac mo ang folder ng skill. Walang agad na binubura."
          }
        },
        "zh-CN": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该技能的文件夹会被移到 Mac 的废纸篓，不会被直接删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The token is deleted from this phone. Your sessions stay on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "トークンはこの iPhone から削除されます。セッションは Mac に残ります。"
